{"ref":"BDB, מַעְבָּרָה","hw":"מַעְבָּרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְבָּרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. ford, pass, passage</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10:29</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְבָּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.2\">Is 16:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.32\">Je 51:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְבְּרוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:7\" href=\"/Joshua.2.7\">Jos 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.4\">1 S 14:4</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:28\" href=\"/Judges.3.28\">Ju 3:28</a> + 2 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>ford</em>, only pl. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:7\" href=\"/Joshua.2.7\">Jos 2:7</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:28\" href=\"/Judges.3.28\">Ju 3:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:5\" href=\"/Judges.12.5\">12:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:6\" href=\"/Judges.12.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.2\">Is 16:2</a>; so also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.7\">1 S 13:7</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">עָֽבְרוּ</span>) We Dr Kit Löhr; + <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְבֶּרֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:46\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.46\">1 K 7:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.17\">2 Ch 4:17</a>, v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, סֻכּוֹת\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_סֻכּוֹת\">סֻכּוֹת</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>pass</em> (wady, ravine), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.4\">1 S 14:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10:29</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>passage</em> in defensive works of Bab. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.32\">Je 51:32</a>.","next":"BDB, עָבַשׁ","prev":"BDB, מַעֲבָר²"}